  Description: You spent your early days in the aftermath of one of the great ravenings.
    You survived thanks to your resourcefulness and perhaps your patron's favor and
    were blessed with skills and drive thereafter, but you must always hold to his
    standards, lest the hunger from the depths seek you out once again. Choose two
    attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute
    boost. You're trained in the Survival skill and the Zevgavizeb Lore skill. You
    gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Ravening's Desperation] skill feat.
